/*
  SignalStatsPanel.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0272 · SignalStatsPanel (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SignalStatsPanel` resolves (table "SignalStatsPanel") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of strings rendered by the web source
  (features/telemetry/components/SignalStatsPanel.tsx) — the explicit i18n keys it
  passes to `t()` (signalStats.noDataInRange / signalStats.hideEmpty) plus the bare
  column / title / empty strings the web passes verbatim as both key and default.
  The second group backs the native chrome: the em-dash "no data" a11y label and the
  P4 leaf freshness / loading / empty / error copy, so the Swift sources hold no
  English literals.
*/

